<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico injects 601 mln in liquidity.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico injects 601 mln in liquidity.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico injected 601 million pesos into the secondary market on Thursday through two auctions, dealers said.</p>
<p>The auctions were assigned  as follows:</p>
<p>    AMOUNT     TERM     AVERAGE</p>
<p>    400 million   20 days  20.30 pct</p>
<p>    201 million    1 days  19.36 pct</p>
<p>*Amounts in pesos</p>
<p>((--Elena Vega, Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9554))</p>
</text>
